---
import ArchitectureFlow from '../react/ArchitectureFlow';
---

<section id="architecture" class="py-20 border-t border-brand-hairline dark:border-brand-border/80 transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="reveal text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-accent tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4">Architecture</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink dark:text-ivory" data-i18n="arch_title">双进程架构</h2>
      <p class="text-brand-muted mt-3" data-i18n="arch_subtitle">Auraxis Agent 的内部结构：主进程负责工具执行与调度，渲染进程负责界面，二者通过 IPC 通信。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <ArchitectureFlow client:idle />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
